minic
======

This project is an independent, from-scratch native Rust implementation of a
terminal coding agent. Its design was informed by studying the behaviour and
architecture of the MIT-licensed project "minicode" (startupmini/minicode),
which served as a behavioural baseline/reference only.

No source code from minicode is copied here. minicode is MIT-licensed; this
project is also MIT-licensed.

Third-party Rust crates used are listed in each crate's Cargo.toml and are
distributed under their own licenses.
